CLASS com/charlesproxy/model/class_949 com/charlesproxy/model/LegacyModelConverter
	COMMENT Rebuilds a current-model Session from a deserialized com.xk72.charles.model one, which is how SerializedSessionImporter reads a session file written by an older Charles. The map keeps node identity stable so a Transaction referenced twice converts once.
	COMMENT Transaction.populate names its parameter of this type "converter" -- that name survived obfuscation. com.xk72.charles.model.class_1224 is the mirror image, converting current to legacy.
